<title>UK: Council of Europe sets 800 mln Ffr callable bond.</title>
<headline>Council of Europe sets 800 mln Ffr callable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Merrill Lynch and Compagnie Parisienne de Reescompte.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COUNCIL OF EUROPE</p>
<p> AMT    800 MLN FFR   COUPON     4.73	MATURITY  **19.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.675   PAY DATE    19.MAR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AAA   REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	+23 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**CALLABLE 19.MAR.02</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS</p>
</text>
